LRC14 Delsarte/Tanner carrier audit (exact fractions)
==============================================================================
Vertex challenge:
  considered vertices: missed-depth atoms, factorial checks, signed edges,
  proof lenses, unit-distance edges, modular branch-address analogies.
  chosen carrier vertices below: atom depths t=0..6 and moment rows r.
  preserved predicate: the THM-534 Delsarte dominance g(t)>=1[t=0].
  destroyed information: actual generated speed words, relation lattice,
  and row-slice odometer geometry from HYP-2737.

